# Dependencies
node_modules/
resume/node_modules/

# The résumé PDF and social card are NOT ignored. They need headless Chromium,
# which Vercel's build container cannot launch — it lacks libnss3/libnspr4 and
# gives no root to install them. So .github/workflows/build-assets.yml rebuilds
# them on GitHub's runner and commits the result, and Vercel just serves the
# files. Still don't edit them by hand: change resume/resume.html or
# tools/og/card.html and let the workflow regenerate them.

# Generated blog — built in CI from content/blog/*.md by tools/blog/build.mjs.
# Edit the Markdown, never the HTML.
/blog/
/sitemap.xml
/robots.txt

# Local preview config (machine-specific)
.claude/

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
